{
  "profile_id": "contribution.noncash.appraisal",
  "version": 2,
  "status": "draft",
  "title": "Qualified appraisal for a noncash contribution",
  "description_for_ai": "A donor or the donor's adviser uploads the qualified appraisal supporting a noncash contribution. The document is evidence attached to the contribution case and reviewed by the complex-asset specialist. Release 1 uses no AI extraction for appraisals (review R2-17); deterministic checks compare the appraisal's dates and values with the gift record and the donor's Form 8283 as consistency checks.",
